<title>USA: Pharmavene reschedules IPO.</title>
<headline>Pharmavene reschedules IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmavene Inc's planned initial public offering, which had previously been postponed, is now tentatively scheduled for mid-October, according to lead underwriter Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>Pharavene develops drug delivery technologies. It plans to offer 2.2 million shares in an estimated price range of $10 to $12. It has filed to trade under the symbol &quot;PHVN&quot; on the Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
